<title>USA: Armco Butler workers ratify labor pact.</title>
<headline>Armco Butler workers ratify labor pact.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Members of the Butler Armco Independent Union (BAIU) have ratified a new five-year labor agreement with Armco Inc, the company said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The new agreement replaces one which expired on September 30. It covers some 1,900 hourly production and maintenance employees at the Butler Operations.</p>
<p>Details of the contract are not being released.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
